  "notes": "Implements the fixture-first ML-Y-113 bridge at draft PR #2235. The app-local module validates renderer-neutral selections, injects governed resolution, enforces returned EvidenceRefs as a subset of clicked selection scope, and reuses the existing no-leak Evidence Drawer. The first hosted test run exposed a test-only false positive because an import guard matched the word MapLibre in documentation; commit dc1f3841 narrows the guard to actual package imports without weakening the renderer boundary. The slice adds no MapLibre dependency, network access, live API route, source activation, policy authority, release state, deployment, or publication."
